## Hypothesis status annotations
- GREEN at RED baseline: `a04_auth_enabled_routes_fail_closed_without_credentials` (protected route rejected without credentials).
- GREEN at RED baseline: `a04_production_bootstrap_rejects_missing_blank_or_short_admin_key` (production bootstrap validator rejected missing/blank/short key and no-auth in production).
- RED finding: `a04_unset_allowed_origins_defaults_to_loopback_only_contract` failed; pre-fix startup-default contract did not enforce loopback-only behavior when `FLAPJACK_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` was unset.
- RED finding: `a04_default_cors_blocks_non_loopback_browser_origins` failed; default CORS path still allowed non-loopback origin (OWASP A04 insecure default).
- RED finding: `a04_shipped_default_search_key_has_bounded_rate_limit` failed; default search key shipped with `maxQueriesPerIPPerHour=0` (unbounded).
